Keep current xAI effort enums, priority service tier, and nullish SSE usage.

Grok 4.6 uses low/medium/high/xhigh and service_tier: priority in both APIs:
https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/text/reasoning
https://docs.x.ai/developers/advanced-api-usage/priority-processing
The bundled adapter otherwise silently strips serviceTier. OpenScience gates
Fast mode by model; absence leaves the provider's standard tier unchanged.

Responses response.created may contain usage: null. Accept nullish usage as
upstream 4.x does, without requiring the incompatible provider 4.x migration.

DELETE THIS PATCH when the AI SDK major migration supplies these fixes.

